        "raw": "Got a bit of a bait and switch as they only did lore/art questions related to RCR and explained what they’ll do for rules questions going forward \nhttps://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-66\n\nUpcoming Schedule\n* Tuesday, May 2nd: Episode #247 - Creative Process: Fashion Foes\n* Tuesday, May 9th: Episode #248 - Creative Process: Lifeline Supporting Cast\n* Tuesday, May 16th: Episode #249 - Creative Process: Rambler Foes\n* Tuesday, May 23rd: Editor’s Note #67\n* Tuesday, May 30th: Episode #250 - Writers’ Room: Scavenger Unity\n\nExpected Recording Schedule:\n* Friday, April 28th: Episode #247 - Creative Process: Fashion Foes\n* Friday, May 5th: Episode #248 - Creative Process: Lifeline Supporting Cast\n* Friday, May 12th: Episode #249 - Creative Process: Rambler Foes\n* Friday, May 19th: Editor’s Note #67\n* Friday, May 26th: Episode #250 - Writers’ Room: Scavenger Unity",
