        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2023-04-19T00:09:39.684Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When they talked about the difference between “supporting cast” and “friends,” was anyone else thinking of Soothsayer Carmichael? Because that’s exactly where my brain went.</p>\n<p>Okay, I feel like they offered a challenge for odd pairings. I rather like odd pairings, and they’ve already done some of that with the Ra/Fanatic romance (“frenemies with benefits” and all), the Expat/Young Legacy friendship, or pretty much anyone with Setback.</p>\n<p>How about…<br>\n-Tempest and Fanatic (without the other Prime Wardens) have to deal with an alien threat that’s posing as a demon-like figure out of ancient Maerynian myths.<br>\n-A team-up like America’s Newest Legacy <span class=\"hashtag\">#521</span>, except add Expatriette this time, you cowards.<br>\n-Ambuscade/Stuntman dealing with Mr Fixer. Can his ego take being around someone who never saw his movies?<br>\n-Wager Master vs Rambler. Whoever wins, the heroes lose.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-04-19T00:09:39.684Z",
